{"variant": "minutes", "year": 1988, "month": 4, "day": 18, "slug": "annual-shareholder-letter-9981", "variant_int": 4, "html": "<section class=\"page-banner\"><div class=\"container\"><p class=\"text-uppercase mb-1\" style=\"color:var(--gold);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.18em;font-size:.75rem\"><a href=\"/archive/\" style=\"color:var(--gold)\">Archive</a> &rsaquo; <a href=\"/archive/1988/\" style=\"color:var(--gold)\">1988</a> &rsaquo; <a href=\"/archive/1988/04/\" style=\"color:var(--gold)\">04</a> &rsaquo; 18</p><p style=\"color:rgba(255,255,255,.6);font-size:.72rem;margin-bottom:.4rem;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase\">Meeting Minutes &bull; MIN-1988-04-6993</p><h1 style=\"font-size:clamp(1.2rem,3vw,2rem);line-height:1.25\">R&amp;D Investment Committee — Annual Shareholder Letter</h1><p style=\"color:rgba(255,255,255,.7);font-size:.9rem;margin-bottom:0\">1988-04-18 &bull; McLean, VA — Tysons Corner Office</p></div></section><section style=\"padding:3rem 0;background:var(--surface)\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"row g-4\"><div class=\"col-lg-8\"><div style=\"background:white;border:1px solid var(--border);border-left:4px solid var(--gold);padding:1.25rem 1.5rem;margin-bottom:2rem\"><div style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em;color:var(--gold);margin-bottom:.5rem\">Meeting Information</div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:.3rem .8rem;font-size:.83rem;margin-bottom:.75rem\"><div><span style=\"font-size:.68rem;opacity:.55;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em\">Committee</span><br><strong>R&amp;D Investment Committee</strong></div><div><span style=\"font-size:.68rem;opacity:.55;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em\">Date</span><br><strong>1988-04-18</strong></div><div><span style=\"font-size:.68rem;opacity:.55;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em\">Location</span><br>McLean, VA — Tysons Corner Office</div><div><span style=\"font-size:.68rem;opacity:.55;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em\">Meeting Ref</span><br><code style=\"font-size:.75rem\">MIN-1988-04-6993</code></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem;padding-top:.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border)\"><span style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:700;padding:.2rem .5rem;background:#dcfce7;color:#15803d;border:1px solid #86efac\">&#10003; QUORUM ESTABLISHED</span><span style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666\">4 of 5 members present</span></div></div><div class=\"mb-4\"><h5 style=\"font-weight:800;color:var(--navy);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;font-size:.8rem;margin-bottom:1rem;padding-bottom:.5rem;border-bottom:2px solid var(--gold)\">Attendance</h5><table class=\"dash-table w-100\"><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Title</th><th>Role</th><th style=\"text-align:center\">Present</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"font-weight:600\">Carlos Lebedev</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem\">Program Coordinator</td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem;color:#666\">Research Fellow</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#15803d;font-weight:700\">&#10003;</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-weight:600\">Usha Karnik</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem\">Manager of Digital Channels</td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem;color:#666\">Invited Guest</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#15803d;font-weight:700\">&#10003;</span></td></tr><tr style=\"opacity:.5\"><td style=\"font-weight:400\">Josephine Fuller</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem\">Director of International Partnerships</td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem;color:#666\">Turnaround Advisor (External)</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#ccc\">&mdash;</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-weight:600\">Yasmin Garza</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem\">Associate, Corporate Development</td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem;color:#666\">Chief Technology Officer</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#15803d;font-weight:700\">&#10003;</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-weight:600\">Tariq Hardin</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem\">Manager of Revenue Enablement</td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem;color:#666\">Recording Secretary</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#15803d;font-weight:700\">&#10003;</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"mb-4\"><h5 style=\"font-weight:800;color:var(--navy);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;font-size:.8rem;margin-bottom:1rem;padding-bottom:.5rem;border-bottom:2px solid var(--gold)\">Agenda</h5><div style=\"margin-bottom:1.5rem;padding-bottom:1.25rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.68rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#999;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Item 1</div><h6 style=\"font-size:.92rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.6rem\">Severance Policy Amendment — Review and Vote</h6><p style=\"font-size:.87rem;line-height:1.7;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">The Severance Policy Amendment — Review and Vote was brought before the committee for a final decision. The matter had been extensively debated in previous meetings. Carlos Lebedev summarized the key arguments for and against the proposal before calling for a vote. The resolution passed by a narrow margin.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:1.5rem;padding-bottom:1.25rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.68rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#999;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Item 2</div><h6 style=\"font-size:.92rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.6rem\">CEO Compensation Review — Annual Assessment</h6><p style=\"font-size:.87rem;line-height:1.7;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">The Chair, Carlos Lebedev, called the meeting to order and moved to the first agenda item, CEO Compensation Review — Annual Assessment. Yasmin Garza provided a high-level overview, referencing the detailed materials in Exhibit B. The ensuing discussion focused on the financial implications, with several members questioning the underlying assumptions. A motion to table the item pending further analysis was proposed.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:1.5rem;padding-bottom:1.25rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.68rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#999;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Item 3</div><h6 style=\"font-size:.92rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.6rem\">Charitable Contributions Budget for FY1988</h6><p style=\"font-size:.87rem;line-height:1.7;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">The committee received a briefing from Usha Karnik on the status of the Charitable Contributions Budget for FY1988. Usha Karnik noted that progress has been made against the Q1 milestones, with the majority of action items from the prior meeting resolved. Remaining open items were reviewed individually. The committee directed the responsible owner to provide a written status update no later than the due date indicated.</p><div style=\"background:#f8f9fb;border:1px solid var(--border);border-left:3px solid var(--navy);padding:.8rem 1rem;margin-top:.65rem\"><div style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.4rem\">Motion</div><p style=\"margin-bottom:.4rem;font-size:.83rem;line-height:1.6;color:#333\"><strong>To approve for brand equity:</strong> RESOLVED, that the R&amp;D Investment Committee declares a quarterly dividend of $121 per share, payable on 1988-04-18 to shareholders of record as of 1988-05-28.</p><div style=\"font-size:.8rem;color:#555;margin-bottom:.3rem\"><strong>Moved:</strong> Yasmin Garza &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; <strong>Seconded:</strong> Usha Karnik</div><div style=\"font-size:.8rem;color:#555\"><strong>Vote:</strong> 3 Yea &nbsp;/&nbsp; 0 Nay &nbsp;/&nbsp; 1 Abstain &nbsp;&mdash;&nbsp; <strong style=\"color:#15803d\">CARRIED</strong></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:1.5rem;padding-bottom:1.25rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.68rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#999;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Item 4</div><h6 style=\"font-size:.92rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.6rem\">Executive Salary Band Recalibration</h6><p style=\"font-size:.87rem;line-height:1.7;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">The committee discussed the Executive Salary Band Recalibration, a review of the company&#x27;s response to a recent data breach. The committee was satisfied with the response and directed the CISO to implement additional security controls.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:1.5rem;padding-bottom:1.25rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.68rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#999;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Item 5</div><h6 style=\"font-size:.92rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.6rem\">Call to Order and Roll Call</h6><p style=\"font-size:.87rem;line-height:1.7;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">The Call to Order and Roll Call was a review of the company&#x27;s compliance with Section 162(m) of the Internal Revenue Code. The committee confirmed that all executive compensation was structured to be deductible.</p><div style=\"background:#f8f9fb;border:1px solid var(--border);border-left:3px solid var(--navy);padding:.8rem 1rem;margin-top:.65rem\"><div style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.4rem\">Motion</div><p style=\"margin-bottom:.4rem;font-size:.83rem;line-height:1.6;color:#333\"><strong>To approve for vision:</strong> RESOLVED, that the R&amp;D Investment Committee approves the divestiture of the Postal Services business unit to Order &amp; Decree Consulting for a total consideration of $121M.</p><div style=\"font-size:.8rem;color:#555;margin-bottom:.3rem\"><strong>Moved:</strong> Tariq Hardin &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; <strong>Seconded:</strong> Yasmin Garza</div><div style=\"font-size:.8rem;color:#555\"><strong>Vote:</strong> 3 Yea &nbsp;/&nbsp; 1 Nay &nbsp;/&nbsp; 0 Abstain &nbsp;&mdash;&nbsp; <strong style=\"color:#15803d\">CARRIED</strong></div></div></div></div><div class=\"mb-4\"><h5 style=\"font-weight:800;color:var(--navy);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;font-size:.8rem;margin-bottom:1rem;padding-bottom:.5rem;border-bottom:2px solid var(--gold)\">Action Items</h5><table class=\"dash-table w-100\"><thead><tr><th style=\"width:2rem\">#</th><th>Description</th><th>Owner</th><th>Due</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"color:#999;font-weight:600\">1</td><td style=\"font-size:.83rem\">Finalize the clawback calculation for the former CEO</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap\">Clint Pineda</td><td style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666;white-space:nowrap\">1988-05-28</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#999;font-weight:600\">2</td><td style=\"font-size:.83rem\">Prepare a report on the company&#x27;s progress on its digital ethics initiatives</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap\">Nir Mcbride</td><td style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666;white-space:nowrap\">1988-06-28</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#999;font-weight:600\">3</td><td style=\"font-size:.83rem\">Evaluate vendors for the new compliance management system</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap\">Ozan Manning</td><td style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666;white-space:nowrap\">1988-05-28</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#999;font-weight:600\">4</td><td style=\"font-size:.83rem\">Evaluate the effectiveness of the company&#x27;s whistleblower hotline</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap\">Mariah Truong</td><td style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666;white-space:nowrap\">1988-05-28</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div style=\"border:1px solid var(--border);padding:1rem 1.2rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem\"><p style=\"font-size:.85rem;color:#333;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:.5rem\">There being no further business, a motion to adjourn was made and carried unanimously. Meeting adjourned at 7:15 PM CT.</p><p style=\"font-size:.83rem;margin-bottom:.75rem;color:#555\"><strong>Next meeting:</strong> 1988-05-05</p><div><p style=\"font-size:.78rem;color:#888;margin-bottom:.25rem\">Respectfully submitted,</p><p style=\"font-size:.85rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.1rem\">Tariq Hardin</p><p style=\"font-size:.78rem;color:#666;margin-bottom:.75rem\">Manager of Revenue Enablement, Recording Secretary</p><div style=\"display:flex;gap:2rem\"><div><div style=\"width:160px;border-bottom:1px solid #aaa;margin-bottom:.2rem;height:1.5rem\"></div><div style=\"font-size:.68rem;color:#888\">Signature</div></div><div><div style=\"width:120px;border-bottom:1px solid #aaa;margin-bottom:.2rem;height:1.5rem\"></div><div style=\"font-size:.68rem;color:#888\">Approved: ___________</div></div></div></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding-top:1rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border)\"><a href=\"/archive/1988/04/17/ransomware-resilience-review-9306/\" style=\"font-size:.85rem;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none\">&larr; Previous</a><a href=\"/archive/1988/04/18/annual-shareholder-letter-9981/international-tax-and-social-security-totalization-agreement-compliance-5489/\" style=\"font-size:.85rem;color:var(--navy);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none\">Next &rarr;</a></div></div><div class=\"col-lg-4 d-none d-lg-block\"><div style=\"position:sticky;top:2rem\"><div class=\"acpwb-card mb-3\"><div style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:var(--gold);margin-bottom:.7rem\">Meeting Record</div><dl class=\"mb-0\" style=\"font-size:.82rem\"><dt style=\"opacity:.55;font-size:.68rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em\">Meeting Ref</dt><dd class=\"mb-2\" style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:.75rem;opacity:.7\">MIN-1988-04-699